# Yuma job names (server roster) and Misfits job descriptions (Misfits (https://github.com/Misfit-Sanctuary/nuclear-14))

job-name-ncr-commander = Base Commander
job-description-ncr-commander = You command the NCR detachment. Set operational priorities, direct your officers, and answer only to high command. Your rank runs from Captain to Major as your service record grows.
job-supervisors-ncr-commander = NCR high command and your mission
job-name-ncr-platoon-leader = Platoon Leader
job-description-ncr-platoon-leader = You lead a platoon in the field, directing NCOs and executing the Commander's orders. Your commision begins at 2LT — earn your 1LT through service.
job-name-ncr-doctor = Doctor
job-description-ncr-doctor = Provide and coordinate battlefield medical care as the NCR medical officer. Follow mission medical orders from command and direct the medical chain of command.
job-name-ncr-requisition-officer = Quartermaster
job-description-ncr-requisition-officer = You are a Quartermaster and Requisition Officer of NCR, maintain the armies' equipment and supervise the allocation of its resources.
job-name-ncr-nco = Squad Leader
job-description-ncr-nco = You lead a squad of NCR troopers, responsible for a fire team and the enlisted under your watch. You start as a Corporal — your chevrons grow from SGT to SSG to SFC with time served.
job-supervisors-ncr-nco = the NCR officers and your chain of command
job-name-ncr-weapon-specialist = Weapon Specialist
job-description-ncr-weapon-specialist = You are a weapons-qualified specialist of the NCR. Your focus is firepower and combat effectiveness — not command. Your rank tracks PV2 through SPC as you accumulate experience.
job-supervisors-ncr-sergeant = the senior NCOs and officers of the NCR
job-name-ncr-medic = Medic
job-description-ncr-medic = Stabilise and treat casualties on the line; follow orders from your Squad Leader and the unit's medical Officer.
job-name-ncr-recruit = Trooper
job-description-ncr-recruit = Junior enlisted trooper. Perform basic duties, follow lawful orders from your Squad Leader, and earn promotions through service and discipline.
job-supervisors-ncr = the NCR chain of command
job-name-f14-n-c-r-garrison-trooper = Garrison Trooper
department-NCR = NCR
department-NCR-description = NCR on Yuma.
job-name-ranger-veteran-n14 = Veteran Ranger
job-description-ranger-veteran-n14 = Lead Ranger operations in the region, choose your methods, and answer only to your mission and your code.
job-supervisors-ranger-veteran = your mission and your code
job-name-ranger-patrol = Ranger
job-description-ranger-patrol = Scout ahead, patrol the frontier, and prove you belong among the Rangers.
job-supervisors-ranger-field = the field rangers and the veteran ranger
department-NCRRangers = NCR Rangers
department-NCRRangers-description = NCR Rangers on Yuma.
job-name-caesar-legion-centurion = Centurion
job-description-caesar-legion-centurion = Lead the Legion beneath the Legate, coordinate officers, and direct the chapter's major campaigns.
job-name-caesar-legion = obey The Augustus.
job-name-caesar-legion-vexillarius = Vexillarius
job-description-caesar-legion-vexillarius = Carry the Legion's standard into battle and rally Caesar's warriors wherever the line begins to falter.
job-name-caesar-legion-other = obey The Augustus, the Legate, the Centurion and the Decani.
job-name-caesar-legion-explorer = Explorer
job-description-caesar-legion-explorer = Range ahead of the Legion's main force as a scout and hunter. Your eyes and your blade are Caesar's reach into the wilds.
job-name-caesar-legion-supervisors = obey The Augustus, the Legate, and the Centurion.
job-name-caesar-legion-houndmaster = Houndmaster
job-description-caesar-legion-houndmaster = Handle the Legion's war dogs and bring them to bear against Caesar's enemies.
job-name-caesar-legion-forgemaster = Forgemaster
job-description-caesar-legion-forgemaster = Oversee the Legion's forges and workshop to produce and maintain equipment for Caesar's war machine. Determine what orders to prioritize or reject, keep troublesome recruits from wasting all the steel.
job-name-caesar-legion-dean = Decanus
job-description-caesar-legion-dean = Lead a smaller fighting unit of the Legion and keep the legionaries beneath you battle-ready and obedient.
job-name-caesar-legion-legionnaire-recruit = Recruit Legionary
job-description-caesar-legionnaire-recruit = Begin your service as a line legionary, learning discipline and violence under the Legion's command structure.
job-name-caesar-legion-legionnaire-warrior = Prime Legionary
job-description-caesar-legion-legionnaire-warrior = Serve as a proven legionary in the Legion's main battle line and hold the standard of Caesar in combat.
job-name-caesar-legion-legionnaire-veteran = Veteran Legionary
job-description-caesar-legion-legionnaire-veteran = Fight as a hardened veteran of Caesar's Legion, trusted with the front line's most brutal work.
job-name-caesar-legion-auxilia = Auxilia
job-description-caesar-legion-auxilia = Keep Caesar's warriors in the fight with wasteland medicine, battlefield triage, and discipline equal to any other legionary.
job-name-caesar-legion-female = obey The Augustus, the Legate, the Centurion, and the Priestess.
job-name-caesar-legion-slave = Slave
job-description-caesar-legion-slave = You are a slave of Caesar's Legion. Obey, survive, and remember that your life belongs to your masters.
job-supervisors-caesar-legion-slave = obey The Augustus, the Legate, the Centurion, and all other members of the Legion.
department-CaesarLegion = Caesar's Legion
department-CaesarLegion-description = Caesar's Legion on Yuma.
job-name-bos-west-elder-comm = Elder
job-description-bos-west-elder-comm = Command the entire Brotherhood chapter and decide its doctrine, diplomacy, and strategic goals.
job-supervisors-bos-west-elder = no one, but your duty to the Brotherhood
job-name-bos-mid-paladin-comm = Head Paladin
job-description-bos-mid-paladin-comm = Lead the martial wing of the Brotherhood chapter and direct field operations.
job-supervisors-bos-mid-commander = the Elder
job-name-bos-headknight = Head Knight
job-description-bos-headknight = Oversee the Brotherhood's knightly orders, logistics, and battlefield readiness.
job-supervisors-bos-headknight = the Elder
job-name-bos-west-scribe = Head Scribe
job-description-bos-west-scribe = Lead the scribes, control technical doctrine, and safeguard the chapter's knowledge.
job-supervisors-bos-west = the Elder
job-name-bos-scribe = Scribe
job-description-bos-scribe = Support the chapter with research, medicine, and technical expertise.
job-supervisors-bos-scribe = the Head Scribe and Elder
job-name-bos-paladin = Paladin
job-description-bos-paladin = Fight as the Brotherhood's frontline heavy infantry and defend the chapter's interests.
job-supervisors-bos-paladin = the Head Paladin and Elder
job-name-bos-knight = Knight
job-description-bos-knight = Protect the chapter, escort missions, and recover technology in the field.
job-supervisors-bos-knight = the Head Knight, and Elder
job-name-bos-initiate = Initiate
job-description-bos-initiate = Learn the Brotherhood's code, follow orders, and earn your place in the chapter.
job-supervisors-bos-initiate = the Brotherhood chain of command
department-BrotherhoodOfSteel = Brotherhood of Steel
department-BrotherhoodOfSteel-description = Brotherhood of Steel on Yuma.
job-name-townmayor = Mayor
job-description-townmayor = Maintain civilisation in the town. Set taxes and laws and try not to be thrown out or taken over.
job-supervisors-townsfolk = the Mayor of the town
job-name-townsheriff = Sheriff
job-description-townsheriff = Maintain law and order within the town and support the Mayor in their rule.
job-name-towndeputy = Deputy
job-description-towndeputy = A law enforcement worker for the town. Keep the peace and provide backup to your Marshal.
job-name-townbartender = Barkeep
job-description-townbartender = Manage the local bar, kitchen, and rooms that are there for renting. Run a business in town!
job-name-farmer = Farmer
job-description-farmer = Produce crops in the wasteland for yourself or to barter with others.
job-supervisors-wastelander = yourself and you alone
job-name-townmechanic = Artisan
job-description-townmechanic = Maintain the towns services and infrastructure and do what you can on the side for others for money.
job-name-townshopkeeper = Merchant
job-description-townshopkeeper = Setup shop in town, organise trade partnerships, and sell your wares to the wanderers of the wastes. Beware the tax man.
job-name-townsperson = Townie
job-description-townsperson = A member of the post-war society. Follow the town rules or try run for Mayor to change them.
department-Townsfolk = Town
department-Townsfolk-description = Town on Yuma.
job-name-tribal-elder = Willowers Chieftan
job-description-tribal-elder = Lead the Willowers through good times and bad times and maintain your beliefs.
job-supervisors-tribal-elder = your best judgement
job-name-tribal = Willowers Tribal
job-description-tribal = Maintain the Willowers' way of life in the wasteland at all costs. Security, crafting, homelife, you do it all.
job-supervisors-tribal = the Tribal Chieftan
job-name-tribal-farmer = Willowers Farmer
job-description-tribal-farmer = Produce food and goods for the Willowers to sustain your living.
job-name-tribal-shaman = Willowers Shaman
job-description-tribal-shaman = Produce medicines and compounds for the Willowers, as is tradition.
department-Tribe = Tribe
department-Tribe-description = Tribe on Yuma.
job-name-follower-director = Followers Director
job-description-follower-director = You head the follower's training program, teaching new volunteers the ways of the Followers and how to survive in the wastes.
job-supervisors-follower-director = the Follower Directors and the Followers' training program
job-name-follower-head = Followers Head
job-description-follower-head = You lead this chapter of the Followers. The sick, the curious, and the desperate look to you for direction. Set the example, protect your people, and keep the mission alive.
job-supervisors-follower-head = yourself and the Followers' founding charter
job-name-follower-doctor = Followers Doctor
job-description-follower-doctor = You are a trained Follower physician. Stitch the wounded, study the wastes, and push medicine into places NCR and Brotherhood dare not go.
job-supervisors-follower-doctor = the Follower Head and the Followers' medical mission
job-name-follower-guard = Followers Guard
job-description-follower-guard = You protect the Followers' clinic, escort doctors into dangerous ground, and keep desperate people from turning the humanitarian mission into another battlefield.
job-supervisors-follower-guard = the Follower Head and the doctors you are protecting
job-name-follower-volunteer = Followers Volunteer
job-description-follower-volunteer = You are new to the Followers. You believe knowledge and compassion can outlast bullets and bombs. Prove it — learn from those above you and help anyone who needs it.
job-supervisors-follower-volunteer = the Follower Doctors and Follower Head above you
department-FollowersOfTheApocalypse = Followers of the Apocalypse
department-FollowersOfTheApocalypse-description = Followers of the Apocalypse on Yuma.
job-name-wastelander = Wastelander
job-description-wastelander = Survive in the wasteland and carve out your own path. It's tough out there alone, consider finding others.
department-Wastelander = Wastelander
department-Wastelander-description = Wastelander on Yuma.
job-name-chief-ranger = Chief Ranger
job-description-chief-ranger = You are the Rangers' supreme field commander. Coordinate veteran operations, set long-range objectives, and ensure the desert's order is upheld. Answer only to your code.
job-supervisors-chief-ranger = the Ranger code and your own judgment
job-name-ncr-citizen = NCR Citizen
job-description-ncr-citizen = You are a citizen of the NCR coming east for work, to help the military as a Civilian contractor.
job-supervisors-ncr-prisoners = the NCR guards holding your sentence
job-name-ncr-engineer = NCR Engineer
job-description-ncr-engineer = Maintain equipment, emplace defenses, and repair systems. Follow technical and tactical orders from your Squad Leader and engineering NCOs.
job-name-ncr-executive-officer = NCR Executive Officer
job-description-ncr-executive-officer = You are the Commander's second, managing the detachment's day-to-day operations and keeping the NCOs in line. Lead by example and bridge command and the ranks below.
job-name-ranger-field = Field Ranger
job-description-ranger-field = Operate independently or in small teams, enforce Ranger law, and protect the frontier.
job-name-ncr-first-sergeant = NCR First Sergeant
job-description-ncr-first-sergeant = Senior NCO responsible for enlisted discipline and unit administration; implement orders from command and issue direction to the enlisted line — take and give orders through your Senior NCO and Officer.
job-supervisors-ncr-lt = the captain of the NCR
job-name-ncr-heavy-trooper = NCR Heavy Trooper
job-description-ncr-heavy-trooper = You are the NCR's walking artillery. Strapped into a salvaged T-45 suit and armed with an LMG, your job is simple: hold the line and lay down fire until there is nothing left standing.
job-name-ncr-heavy-trooper-lead = NCR Heavy Trooper Lead
job-description-ncr-heavy-trooper-lead = Lead NCR heavy troopers in the field, coordinate heavy weapons, and hold the line.
job-name-lieutenant-colonel = NCR Lieutenant Colonel
job-description-ltcol = You command the NCR detachment at the highest field level, coordinating officers, squads, and strategy while answering only to senior command. Legends tell you jumped all the way from staff sergeant.
job-supervisors-ncr-ltcol = NCR high command and your mission
job-name-ncr-mp-investigator = NCR Military Police Investigator
job-description-ncr-mp-investegator = You are a Military Police Investigator for the New California Republic. Investigate crimes within NCR jurisdiction, interrogate suspects, and ensure military law is upheld.
job-supervisors-ncr-mp = the NCR Military Police Captain
job-name-ncr-major = NCR Major
job-description-ncr-major = You are the senior command billet of the New California Republic in this region. Your authority supersedes the Captain. Your appointment is by administrative directive — act with restraint and purpose.
job-supervisors-ncr-major = NCR High Command
job-name-ncr-military-police-captain = NCRMP First Lieutenant
job-description-ncr-military-police-captain = You are responsible for ensuring the law is upheld and followed within this NCR battalion. Lead the NCR Military police with due competence - and make sure no crime goes unpunished.
job-supervisors-ncr-militarypolice-captain = high command. DO NOT LEAVE NCR TERRITORY UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES.
job-name-ncr-military-police-recruit = NCRMP Specialist
job-description-ncr-military-police-recruit = Learn from your betters and enforce NCR law accordingly.
job-supervisors-ncr-militarypolice-recruit = every member of the NCRMP above you. DO NOT LEAVE NCR TERRITORY UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES.
job-name-ncr-military-police-sergeant = NCRMP Staff Sergeant
job-description-ncr-military-police-sergeant = You are responsible for ensuring the law is upheld and followed within this NCR battalion. Lead the fledgling military police recruits and learn every letter of the law.
job-supervisors-ncr-militarypolice-sergeant = the Military Police First Lieutenant. DO NOT LEAVE NCR TERRITORY UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES.
job-name-ncr-prisoner = NCR Prisoner
job-description-ncr-prisoner = You are a prisoner held by the New California Republic. Serve your sentence, follow orders, and perhaps find a way to earn your freedom — or take it.
job-name-ncr-private-first-class = NCR Private First Class
job-description-ncr-private-first-class = Experienced line trooper. Carry out orders from your Squad Leader and support the squad as directed.
job-name-ncr-provost = NCR Provost
job-description-ncr-provost = You are An investigator sent on behalf of the Provost office.
job-supervisors-ncr-provost = The Law and the orders of the provost office
job-name-ncr-ranger = NCR Ranger
job-description-ncr-ranger = Elite scout and combat trooper. Operate independently or lead small teams under orders from your Squad Leader and mission command.
job-supervisors-ncr-ranger = the senior Rangers and your code
job-name-ncr-ranger-recruit = Ranger Recruit
job-description-ncr-ranger-recruit = You are brand new to the Rangers at the Bonneville station. Follow orders, learn the ropes, and prove you have what it takes to earn your badge.
job-supervisors-ncr-ranger-recruit = The major, the Patrol Rangers, and Field Rangers above you
job-name-ncr-private = NCR Private
job-description-ncr-private = Entry-level line trooper. Carry out orders from your immediate Squad Leader and learn the basics of squad discipline.
job-name-ncr-staff-sergeant = NCR Staff Sergeant
job-description-ncr-staff-sergeant = Lead squads or sections in the field; issue and execute orders within the chain of command and act on directions from your Senior NCO and Officer.
job-supervisors-ncr-first-sergeant = the lieutenant and captain of the NCR
job-name-ncr-trader = NCR Trader
job-description-ncr-trader = You are a Caravaneer and a citizen of the NCR, supplying the republic's trade routes.
job-name-ncr-vertibird-pilot = NCR Vertibird Pilot
job-description-ncr-vertibird-pilot = You fly the Republic's vertibirds. Insertion, extraction, and casualty evacuation are yours to run, and the bird you are given is worth more than the platoon riding in it. You hold a warrant, not a commission — you start as a Warrant Officer and climb to CW3 on flight hours alone.
job-supervisors-ncr-vertibird-pilot = the NCR officers and the airframe you are trusted with
job-name-ranger-chief = Chief Desert Ranger
job-description-ranger-chief = As Chief Desert Ranger, you lead all ranger operations, ensuring the safety and training of your ranks. Your mission is to forge alliances, direct large-scale missions, and maintain the legacy of justice in the wasteland.
